{"name":"Blue Plaza","hex":"#30363c","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blue","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a blue hue.","Depressed, melancholic, sad."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The colour of the clear sky or the deep sea; the colour midway between green and violet in the visible spectrum and one of the primary additive colours.","Anything coloured blue, especially to distinguish it from similar objects differing only in colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blue"},{"term":"plaza","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A town's public square.","An open area used for gathering in a city, often having small trees and sitting benches."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/plaza"}],"entries":[{"title":"Town square","blocks":[{"text":"A town square, also called a plaza or piazza, is an open public space commonly found in the heart of a traditional town or city, and which may sometimes be used for community gatherings. Related concepts are the civic center, the market square and the village green."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Piazza_della_Signoria.jpg/330px-Piazza_della_Signoria.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Town_square","wikidata":"Q174782"},{"title":"Blue","blocks":[{"text":"Blue is one of the three primary colours in the RGB (additive) colour model, as well as in the RYB colour model. It lies between violet and cyan on the spectrum of visible light. The term blue generally describes colours perceived by humans observing light with a dominant wavelength between approximately 450 and 495 nanometres. The clear daytime sky and the deep sea appear blue because of an optical effect known as Rayleigh scattering. An optical effect called the Tyndall effect explains blue eyes. Distant objects appear more blue because of another optical effect called aerial perspective."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg/330px-Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue","wikidata":"Q1088"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/KongressfallofAH.jpg/500px-KongressfallofAH.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/KongressfallofAH.jpg/1280px-KongressfallofAH.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/KongressfallofAH.jpg/500px-KongressfallofAH.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Announcement of the establishment of the State of Slovenes, Croats and Serbs on Congress Square in 1918","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AKongressfallofAH.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Saint_Peter%27s_Square_Argos.jpg/500px-Saint_Peter%27s_Square_Argos.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Saint_Peter%27s_Square_Argos.jpg/1280px-Saint_Peter%27s_Square_Argos.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Saint_Peter%27s_Square_Argos.jpg/500px-Saint_Peter%27s_Square_Argos.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Saint Peter's Square is the heart of the Greek city of Argos.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASaint_Peter's_Square_Argos.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Fountain_People%27s_Square_Shanghai.jpg/500px-Fountain_People%27s_Square_Shanghai.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=par